Goto Naviagation&#x1f447; English Young Dada Khachar&rsquo;s Devotion and Shriji Maharaj&rsquo;s Divine Grace After gracing various regions during His spiritual travels (vicharan), Shri Hari arrived in Gadhpur. Preparations were underway in the Darbargadh to celebrate the auspicious festival of Vasant Panchami with great grandeur. At that time, Darbar Ebhal Bapu and young Dada Khachar came to see Shri Hari at the Akshar Ordi. Shriji Maharaj lovingly seated young Dada Khachar close beside Him.
Darbar Ebhal Bapu folded his hands and prayed, &ldquo;O Maharaj! Little Dado asks every single day, &lsquo;When will Maharaj come?&rsquo; Every afternoon, he insists that his mother and aunt prepare delicious, fine meals, and then sits at the main gate (deli), eagerly awaiting Your arrival! Waiting until one o&rsquo;clock in the afternoon, he carries the freshly prepared meal to the sadhus&rsquo; quarters and offers it to them. When his mother and aunt urge him, &lsquo;Now you please eat,&rsquo; he replies, &lsquo;That food was prepared only for Maharaj and the holy sadhus! Until Shriji Maharaj returns to Gadhada and grants me His divine darshan, I shall partake only of simple bajra rotlo and urad dal!&rsquo; Saying this, he eats only urad dal and rotlo late in the afternoon!&rdquo;
Hearing this touching account from Ebhal Bapu, tears of divine love welled up in Shriji Maharaj&rsquo;s eyes, and He tenderly embraced young Dada Khachar, lifting him into His arms.
Shriji Maharaj said, &ldquo;O Ebhal Bapu! This Dado will illuminate your lineage; his glorious name shall be celebrated across lands far and wide! Your entire family is truly blessed and profoundly pure.&rdquo;
Maharaj then lovingly seated Dada Khachar on His lap. Seeing this, Ebhal Bapu reverently stepped forward to lift the child from Maharaj&rsquo;s lap. But Maharaj stopped him, saying, &ldquo;Let him sit in My lap! Did We not tell you that your sons and daughters belong to Us? It is truly for the sake of this Dada Khachar that We traveled across the length and breadth of Bharatvarsh, came to this sacred place, and made Our permanent home in Gadhada!&rdquo;
From Bhagwan Shri Swaminarayan&hellip; 🙏
